/S /H3
/P 41 0 R
/T (A fitness center currently enrolls new members using a printed registration form at the front desk. This process is slow, makes member information difficult to manage, and does not provide a structured record of a member's fitness goals or medical conditions before training begins. Trainers also have no visibility into member preferences before the first session.)
/E (A fitness center currently enrolls new members using a printed registration form at the front desk. This process is slow, makes member information difficult to manage, and does not provide a structured record of a member's fitness goals or medical conditions before training begins. Trainers also have no visibility into member preferences before the first session.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
