/Title (A fitness center currently enrolls new members using a printed registration form at the front desk. This process is slow, makes member information difficult to manage, and does not provide a structured record of a member's fitness goals or medical conditions before training begins. Trainers also have no visibility into member preferences before the first session.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 436 0 R
/Next 469 0 R
>>
